* amp_models.lib  -  12V gitar amfisi (dumble-clone) icin modeller
* Micro-Cap 12.2.0 ile kullanilmak uzere toplandi, 2026-11-10
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* BF245B  - datasheet tipik degerlerinden kurulan NJF modeli (YAKLASIK)
*   NXP/onsemi BF245B: IDSS 6-15 mA, VGS(ID=200uA, VDS=15V) -1.6..-3.8 V
*   Secilen: IDSS = 10 mA, VTO = -2.5 V  ->  BETA = IDSS/VTO^2 = 1.6 mA/V^2
*   Kontrol: ID=200uA'de VGS = -2.5*(1-sqrt(0.02)) = -2.15 V (aralikta)
*   CGS/CGD/KF/AF Micro-Cap jfet.lib "Process 50" kaydindan alindi.
*   (jfet.lib'deki BF245B kaydi BETA=286m -> IDSS~2.7 A, kullanilmadi)
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
.MODEL BF245B_DS NJF (VTO=-2.5 BETA=1.6m LAMBDA=20m IS=10f RS=10 RD=10
+ CGD=1.542479p CGS=2.567003p PB=1.0 KF=7.905907f AF=499.953m)
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* LM386EE - EasyEDA / signality.co.uk, last edited 150611
* Kaynak: sci.electronics.design "LM386 & Spice" (2015), Andy Fierman
* https://www.electronics-related.com/showthread/sci.electronics.design/492438-4.php
* IC pins:       2   3   7   1   8   5   6   4
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
.SUBCKT LM386EE inn inp byp g1 g8 out vs gn4
Q1 gn4 INN q1e gn4 PNP1EE
R1 INN gn4 50k
Q2 gn4 INP q2e gn4 PNP1EE
R2 INP gn4 50k
Q3 gn4 q1e q4e gn4 PNP1EE
Q4 q4c q1e q4e gn4 PNP1EE
Q5 gn4 q2e q6e gn4 PNP1EE
Q6 q15b q2e q6e gn4 PNP1EE
Q7 q4c q4c gn4 gn4 NPNEE
Q8 q15b q4c gn4 gn4 NPNEE
R3 q4e q1e 28.25k
R4 g0 q4e 100
R5 q2e q6e 28.25k
R6 G1 q6e 100
R7 G8 g0 150
R8 G1 G8 1.35k
R9 OUT G1 15k
R10 BYP g0 15k
R11 q10c BYP 15k
Q9 gn4 q10c q10b gn4 PNP1EE
Q10 q10c q10b VS gn4 PNP1EE
Q11 q11c q10b VS gn4 PNP1EE
Q12 q12c q10b VS gn4 PNP1EE
Q13 gn4 q4c q11c gn4 PNP2EE
Q14 q18b q11c q14e gn4 NPNEE
R12 q14e gn4 1k
Q15 gn4 q15b q12c gn4 PNP2EE
Q16 q18b q12c q17b gn4 NPNEE
Q17 q23b q17b gn4 gn4 NPNEE
C2 q23b gn4 1p
Q18 q18b q18b VS gn4 PNP2EE
Q19 comp q18b VS gn4 PNP2EE
Q20 q25b q18b VS gn4 PNP2EE
Q21 comp comp q22b gn4 NPNEE 5
C1 comp q15b 15p
R13 q25b comp 10
Q22 q25b q22b q23b gn4 NPNEE 5
Q23 q24b q23b q23e gn4 PNP2EE
Q24 q23e q24b gn4 gn4 NPNEE 100
R14 OUT q23e 4
Q25 VS q25b q25e gn4 NPNEE 100
R15 q25e OUT 4
.MODEL NPNEE NPN(IS=1E-14 VAF=100 BF=400 IKF=0.4 XTB=1.5 BR=4 CJC=1E-12 ITF=1 VTF=2 XTF=3)
.MODEL PNP1EE PNP(IS=1E-14 VAF=100 BF=100 IKF=0.4 XTB=1.5 BR=4 CJC=1E-12 ITF=1 VTF=2 XTF=3)
.MODEL PNP2EE PNP(IS=1E-14 VAF=100 BF=200 IKF=0.4 XTB=1.5 BR=4 CJC=1E-12 ITF=1 VTF=2 XTF=3)
.ENDS LM386EE
*
* NOT: Orijinalde transistorlerin alt ucu (substrate) ve emitorler "0"
* (global toprak) baglidir; burada pin 4 (gn4) kullanildi. Devrede pin 4
* topraga bagli oldugu icin sonuc ayni.
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* LM386DD - "No-Frills LM386 Model", Dave Dilatush, 1995-05-30
* Kaynak: sci.electronics.design "LM386 & Spice" (2015), J. Thompson repost
* https://www.electronics-related.com/showthread/sci.electronics.design/492438-1.php
* IC pins: 2 3 7 1 8 5 6 4
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
.SUBCKT LM386DD inn inp byp g1 g8 out vs gn4
q1 gn4 inn 10011 ddpnp
r1 inn gn4 50k
q2 gn4 inp 10012 ddpnp
r2 inp gn4 50k
q3 10013 10011 10008 ddpnp
q4 10014 10012 g1 ddpnp
r3 vs byp 15k
r4 byp 10008 15k
r5 10008 g8 150
r6 g8 g1 1.35k
r7 g1 out 15k
q5 10013 10013 gn4 ddnpn 1.1
q6 10014 10013 gn4 ddnpn
q7 10017 10014 gn4 ddnpn 10
c1 10014 10017 15pf
i1 10002 vs dc 5m
q8 10004 10002 vs ddpnp
q9 10002 10002 vs ddpnp
q10 10018 10017 out ddpnp 10
q11 10004 10004 10009 ddnpn 100
q12 10009 10009 10017 ddnpn 100
q13 vs 10004 out ddnpn 100
q14 out 10018 gn4 ddnpn 100
.MODEL ddnpn NPN(Is=10f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=100
+ Bf=150 Ise=0 Ne=1.5 Ikf=0 Nk=.5 Xtb=1.5 Var=100
+ Br=1 Isc=0 Nc=2 Ikr=0 Rc=0 Cjc=2p Mjc=.3333
+ Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=5p Mje=.3333 Vje=.75 Tr=10n
+ Tf=1n Itf=1 Xtf=0 Vtf=10)
.MODEL ddpnp PNP(Is=10f Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Vaf=100
+ Bf=40 Ise=0 Ne=1.5 Ikf=0 Nk=.5 Xtb=1.5 Var=100
+ Br=1 Isc=0 Nc=2 Ikr=0 Rc=0 Cjc=2p Mjc=.3333
+ Vjc=.75 Fc=.5 Cje=5p Mje=.3333 Vje=.75 Tr=100n
+ Tf=10n Itf=1 Xtf=0 Vtf=10)
.ENDS LM386DD
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* TDA2003 - SPICE MODELING by JIM THOMPSON, analog-innovations.com (c) 2014
* Topluluk modeli, yari-davranissal (YAKLASIK).
* Kaynak: KiCad forumu, "Anyone successfully simulated a TDA2003 amplifier?"
* https://forum.kicad.info/t/anyone-successfully-simulated-a-tda2003-amplifier/66080
* Forumdaki metinde satir sonlari ve '*' (carpma) isaretleri kaybolmustu;
* satirlar ve carpmalar yeniden kuruldu. holger'in duzeltmesi uygulandi
* (G_G1 icindeki "5A" -> "5").
* Dogrulama: Jim Thompson'in orijinal dosyasi (analog-innovations.com/TDA2003.zip,
* web.archive.org 2015-02-12 kaydi) ile satir satir ayni oldugu kontrol edildi.
* Pinler: 1=IN+  2=IN-  3=GND  4=OUT  5=VPLUS
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
.SUBCKT TDA2003 1 2 3 4 5
R_R6 1 N_1 150K
RCON_TAG2 1 0 1G
V_VOS2 N_2 2 0.65V
R_R8 5 N_3 20K
V_VOS1 N_1 3 1.3V
F_F1 2 3 VF_F1 0.5
VF_F1 N_3 3 1.8V
D_D1 N_4 N_5 DJT
RCON_TAG3 N_6 0 1G
G_G1 N_7 N_6 VALUE={5*TANH(450*V(N_8,N_6))}
R_R7 2 4 20K
F_F3 N_4 5 VF_F3 1
VF_F3 5 N_7 0
D_D2 5 N_4 DJT
R_RNOF1 5 4 1G
RFUD1 N_9 N_8 1
RFUD2 N_8 0 1G
RCON_TAG4 N_9 0 1G
R_RNOF2 4 3 1G
C_COUT 4 3 5pF
F_F2 5 3 VF_F2 1
VF_F2 N_5 5 0
X_U1 1 N_2 N_9 5 3 OpAmpConfigRails PARAMS: GDC=100K GBW=10 SLEW=1
+ ROUT=100 PM=45 VMP=0.65 VMN=0.65 W=10m
R_ROUT N_6 4 120m
.MODEL DJT D
.ENDS TDA2003
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* TDA2003_DS - Jim Thompson (2014) TDA2003 yapisi + ST datasheet duzeltmeleri
* Neden: Orijinal model cikis DC'sini ic 20k geri beslemeyle Vs/2'ye
* oturtuyor; datasheet uygulama devresindeki dis 220 ohm (R1) bu ayari
* bozuyor ve cikis ~0.7 V'ta kaliyor. Asagidaki degisiklikler ST TDA2003
* datasheet'inden (Vs=14.4 V, Tamb=25 C) alinan degerlere gore yapildi:
*  - Bos cikis gerilimi Vo = 6.9 V typ -> Vo/Vs = 0.479 (cok yavas
*    suzulmus besleme uzerinden izlenir)
*  - SVR = 36 dB @100 Hz (Gv=40 dB devresinde) -> girise indirgenmis
*    besleme katsayisi 2.8e-4
*  - Bos akim Id = 44 mA @14.4 V (besleme ile oransal)
*  - Pin 1 giris direnci 150 k (orijinalde de var)
*  - Acik cevrim kazanci 80 dB @1 kHz, 60 dB @10 kHz -> GDC=100k, GBW=10 MHz
*    (orijinalde de ayni)
*  - Satürasyon: Po = 6 W @4 ohm, THD %10 -> taraf basina ~1.1 V dusum
*    (VMP=VMN=0.95 V + 120 mohm cikis direnci)
*  - Giris gurultusu eN = 1 uV (22 Hz-22 kHz) ~ 6.7 nV/rtHz -> 2.7k seri direnc
* Pinler: 1=IN+ 2=IN- 3=GND 4=OUT 5=VS
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
.SUBCKT TDA2003_DS 1 2 3 4 5
R_R6 1 N_1 150K
RCON_TAG2 1 0 1G
V_VOS1 N_1 3 1.3V
R_SF 5 N_SF 1MEG
C_SF N_SF 3 1u
E_VOS2 N_2 3 VALUE={V(2,3)+1.3-0.479*V(N_SF,3)+2.8E-4*V(5,N_SF)}
R_EN N_2 N_2N 2.7k
D_D1 N_4 N_5 DJT
RCON_TAG3 N_6 0 1G
G_G1 N_7 N_6 VALUE={5*TANH(450*V(N_8,N_6))}
R_R7 2 4 20K
F_F3 N_4 5 VF_F3 1
VF_F3 5 N_7 0
D_D2 5 N_4 DJT
R_RNOF1 5 4 1G
RFUD1 N_9 N_8 1
RFUD2 N_8 0 1G
RCON_TAG4 N_9 0 1G
R_RNOF2 4 3 1G
C_COUT 4 3 5pF
F_F2 5 3 VF_F2 1
VF_F2 N_5 5 0
G_IQ 5 3 VALUE={44m*V(5,3)/14.4}
X_U1 1 N_2N N_9 5 3 OpAmpConfigRails PARAMS: GDC=100K GBW=10 SLEW=1
+ ROUT=100 PM=45 VMP=0.95 VMN=0.95 W=10m
R_ROUT N_6 4 120m
.MODEL DJT D
.ENDS TDA2003_DS
*
.SUBCKT OpAmpConfigRails INP INN OUT VP VN PARAMS: GDC=100K GBW=10 SLEW=1
+ ROUT=100 PM=45 VMP=0.5 VMN=0.5 W=10m
.PARAM PI=3.141593 PMR={PM/180*PI} GBR={GBW*1E6*2*PI} DELT={(90-PM)/90}
.PARAM OMEGAZ={GBR/DELT} PROCPM={(1-TAN(PMR/2))/(1+TAN(PMR/2))}
.PARAM LL={(PROCPM-DELT)/GBR/GBR/(PROCPM-(1/DELT))}
.PARAM RR={(1-OMEGAZ*OMEGAZ*LL)/OMEGAZ}
RRR VP VN 100Meg
G1 0 N2 N1 0 1
G2 N2 0 N2 N3 1
R1 N3 OUT {ROUT}
R2 N2 0 {GDC}
R3 N5 N4 {RR/(sqrt(LL))}
XLIM N2 N3 VP VN SwingLimiter PARAMS: VMP={VMP} VMN={VMN} W={W}
E2 N1 0 VALUE={LIMIT(V(N4),-(SLEW)/(2*PI*GBW),SLEW/(2*PI*GBW))}
E3 N5 0 INP INN 1
RE3 N5 0 100K
E4 0 N6 INP INN 1
RE4 N6 0 100K
C1 0 N2 {1/(2*PI*GBW*1E6)}
C2 N4 N7 {sqrt(LL)}
L1 N7 N6 {sqrt(LL)}
.ENDS OpAmpConfigRails
*
.SUBCKT MOST_POS A B OUT COM PARAMS: W=0.1
E1 OUT COM VALUE={(TANH(V(A,B)/(0.679*W))*V(A,B)+V(A)+V(B))/2}
.ENDS MOST_POS
*
.SUBCKT MOST_NEG A B OUT COM PARAMS: W=0.1
E1 OUT COM VALUE={(TANH(V(B,A)/(0.679*W))*V(A,B)+V(A)+V(B))/2}
.ENDS MOST_NEG
*
.SUBCKT SwingLimiter IN OUT VP VN PARAMS: VMP=0.5 VMN=0.5 W=10m
X_U1 N_1 N_2 OUT 0 MOST_NEG PARAMS: W={W}
V_VOS2 N_3 VN {VMN}
V_VOS1 VP N_2 {VMP}
X_U2 IN N_3 N_1 0 MOST_POS PARAMS: W={W}
.ENDS SwingLimiter
*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
* Micro-Cap sarmalayicilari (wrapper) - generic sembollere baglamak icin
* Opamp_subckt_7 dugum sirasi: PinA PinB PinG PinE PinF PinC PinD
*   PinA=+in -> pin3 (inp)   PinB=-in -> pin2 (inn)   PinG=ust -> pin6 (vs)
*   PinE=alt sag -> pin8 (g8) PinF=cikis -> pin5 (out)
*   PinC=alt sol -> pin1 (g1) PinD=alt orta -> pin7 (byp)
*   pin4 (gnd) = global toprak (0)
* Opamp_subckt_5 dugum sirasi: 1=+in 2=-in 3=V+ 4=V- 5=cikis
*   TDA2003: IN+=1  IN-=2  VS=3  GND=4  OUT=5
* ---------------------------------------------------------------
.SUBCKT LM386EE_W PinA PinB PinG PinE PinF PinC PinD
X1 PinB PinA PinD PinC PinE PinF PinG 0 LM386EE
.ENDS LM386EE_W
*
.SUBCKT LM386DD_W PinA PinB PinG PinE PinF PinC PinD
X1 PinB PinA PinD PinC PinE PinF PinG 0 LM386DD
.ENDS LM386DD_W
*
* TDA2003_W artik datasheet duzeltmeli TDA2003_DS modelini kullanir.
* Orijinal Jim Thompson modeli icin X1 satirinda TDA2003 yazin.
.SUBCKT TDA2003_W 1 2 3 4 5
X1 1 2 4 5 3 TDA2003_DS
.ENDS TDA2003_W
